cloud-architecture-diagram

direction right
typeface clean
styleMode shadow
colorMode pastel

Domain Services [color: green] {
  Catalog [label: "Catalog & Pricing"]
  Checkout [label: "Checkout & Orders"]
  Inventory [label: "Inventory"]
}

Authoritative State [color: purple] {
  PostgreSQL [icon: aws-rds, label: "RDS PostgreSQL\nSystem of Record"]
}

Transaction-to-Event Bridge [color: yellow] {
  Outbox [label: "Transactional Outbox"]
  Relay [label: "Outbox Relay"]
  EventBridge [icon: aws-eventbridge]
}

Consumer Buffers [color: orange] {
  SearchQueue [icon: aws-simple-queue-service, label: "Search Index Queue"]
  FulfilmentQueue [icon: aws-simple-queue-service, label: "Fulfilment Queue"]
  NotificationQueue [icon: aws-simple-queue-service, label: "Notification Queue"]
  AnalyticsQueue [icon: aws-simple-queue-service, label: "Analytics Queue"]
}

Derived / Ephemeral State [color: blue] {
  Search [icon: aws-opensearch-service, label: "OpenSearch\nDerived Index"]
  Cache [icon: aws-elasticache, label: "Valkey\nCache / Ephemeral"]
}

External [color: gray] {
  ERP [label: "ERP / Warehouse"]
  Notifications [label: "Messaging Providers"]
  Analytics [label: "Analytics Platform"]
}

Catalog > PostgreSQL: Catalog truth
Checkout > PostgreSQL: Orders / payment state
Inventory > PostgreSQL: Inventory / reservations

Catalog > Cache: Cache-aside
Checkout > Cache: Safe ephemeral data

PostgreSQL > Outbox: Same DB transaction
Outbox > Relay: Poll / claim committed events
Relay > EventBridge: Publish domain events

EventBridge > SearchQueue, FulfilmentQueue, NotificationQueue, AnalyticsQueue: Route + fan-out
SearchQueue > Search: Idempotent indexing
FulfilmentQueue > ERP: Async integration
NotificationQueue > Notifications: Async delivery
AnalyticsQueue > Analytics: Async events

legend [position: bottom-left] {
  [color: purple, label: "Authoritative"]
  [color: blue, label: "Derived / ephemeral"]
  [connection: -->, label: "Request / event"]
}
